<title>USA: York Research Corp Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>York Research Corp Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Nine Months Ended  For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				November 30,	  November 30,</p>
<p>			  1996	  1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p>Total revenues</p>
<p>		  $19,778,448  $9,739,151 $10,557,367  $3,682,530</p>
<p>Income from operations before</p>
<p>  income taxes  7,781,584   3,171,286   3,218,053   1,684,965</p>
<p> Net income     5,719,594   2,996,286   2,176,053   1,609,965</p>
<p>Net income per common</p>
<p>  share - primary:   0.38	  0.24	  0.14	  0.12</p>
<p>Net income per common share - fully diluted:</p>
<p>			   0.37	  0.24	  0.14	  0.12</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common shares and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>		   15,470,050  15,842,686  15,559,756  16,190,220</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610.</p>
